---
import { business } from '../content/business';
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Left Column: Key Trust Guarantees -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="eyebrow">TRUSTED SAN FRANCISCO PROFESSIONALS</p>
        <h2 id="why-title" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#0d233a] tracking-tight mt-2">
          Meeting the Team You Can Count On Year After Year
        </h2>
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#c81e1e] mt-3 rounded-full"></div>

        <p class="mt-5 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Backflow prevention isn’t just a city requirement — it’s the primary barrier protecting your building’s drinking water
          from hazardous chemical siphoning, irrigation fertilizers, and boiler contaminants. When you choose AAA Backflow Testing,
          you work directly with dedicated, state-certified technicians who take pride in meticulous craftsmanship.
        </p>

        <!-- Feature Points with Clean Icons -->
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-[#155eef] flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              ✓
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0d233a]">Direct SFPUC &amp; DPH Portal Submission</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">We file your test reports electronically within 24 hours so you are never penalized for city filing delays.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-[#155eef] flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              ✓
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0d233a]">NIST-Calibrated Precision Digital &amp; Analog Gauges</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">All test kits undergo mandatory annual factory calibration to guarantee exact differential pressure readings.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-[#155eef] flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              ✓
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0d233a]">All Makes &amp; Valve Sizes Serviced (1/2" to 10")</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">From residential Wilkins lawn valves to 8-inch commercial Febco &amp; Watts fire line assemblies.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-[#155eef] flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              ✓
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#0d233a]">Fully Licensed, Insured &amp; Bonded ($2M Coverage)</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Comprehensive general liability and worker’s compensation protecting residential and commercial properties.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-cta text-sm px-6 py-3">
            Contact Our Team
          </a>
          <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-ghost text-sm px-5 py-3">
            Read Our Credentials
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Photography Mosaic -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 max-w-md mx-auto lg:max-w-none">
          <div class="space-y-3.5">
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border-2 border-white">
              <img
                src="/images/team-lead.jpg"
                alt="Lead master technician in workshop"
                class="w-full h-56 object-cover"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#0b2341] text-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-lg text-center flex flex-col justify-center">
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-300 font-bold">Certification</span>
              <span class="text-xl font-black mt-1">AWWA &amp; ABPA</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1">Certified Cross-Connection Specialists</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3.5 pt-6">
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border-2 border-white">
              <img
                src="/images/service-testing.jpg"
                alt="Gauge testing in progress"
                class="w-full h-44 object-cover"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border-2 border-white">
              <img
                src="/images/service-repair.jpg"
                alt="Precision tools and valve assembly rebuild"
                class="w-full h-52 object-cover"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

